{#
| Variable                  | Type       | Description                                      |
|---------------------------|------------|--------------------------------------------------|
| component                 | object     | merchant settings from twilight.json             |
| component.title_highlight | string     | highlighted heading part (royal blue)            |
| component.title           | string     | rest of the heading (dark)                        |
| component.subtitle        | string     | subheading                                        |
| component.items           | Collection | stat cards (number · label)                       |
| item.number               | string     | the big figure (Poppins)                          |
| item.label                | string     | label under the figure                            |
| position                  | int        | sorting block                                     |

Figma: desktop 172:4097 (1440) — heading + subtitle, then a row of 4 gradient cards.
       mobile  340:3456 (428)  — same, cards as a 2×2 grid; smaller heading/number.
Each card: white→baby-blue gradient, radius 20, number (royal blue) over label (dark blue).
#}
<section class="s-block qstats" id="qstats-{{ position }}">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="qstats__inner">

            {# centered title — same pattern as qissa-products #}
            <div class="qstats__head">
                <h2 class="qstats__title">
                    <span class="qstats__title-hl">{{ component.title_highlight }}</span> {{ component.title }}
                </h2>
                {% if component.subtitle %}
                    <p class="qstats__subtitle">{{ component.subtitle }}</p>
                {% endif %}
            </div>

            {# stat cards — row of 4 (desktop) / 2×2 grid (mobile) #}
            {% if component.items|length %}
                <div class="qstats__grid">
                    {% for item in component.items %}
                        <div class="qstats__card">
                            <span class="qstats__num">{{ item.number }}</span>
                            {% if item.label %}<span class="qstats__label">{{ item.label }}</span>{% endif %}
                        </div>
                    {% endfor %}
                </div>
            {% endif %}

        </div>
    </div>
</section>
